BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td (Tindleworth Robotics - Kestrel K2 Warranty Policy \(fictional test document, experiment E2\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Scope) Tj T* (This policy covers Kestrel K2 drones, charging docks and battery packs delivered under any plan.) Tj T* (It does not cover damage from flying outside the limits in the programme specification,) Tj T* (unauthorised firmware, or accidents caused by third parties.) Tj T* () Tj T* (2. How to make a claim) Tj T* (Open a ticket in the maintenance app with the drone serial number and flight logs.) Tj T* (A replacement drone is shipped within five working days in pilot cities.) Tj T* () Tj T* (3. Exclusions) Tj T* (Propellers and parcel boxes are wear parts and are not covered.) Tj T* (Cosmetic scratches are not covered.) Tj T* () Tj T* (\(continued on page 2\)) Tj T* ET
